    "name": "1. Does Texas require medical malpractice insurance? ",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Medical malpractice is not mandatory by state however hospitals and health organizations can require employees to have medical malpractice insurance. It is also recommended for private practitioners to get medical malpractice insurance."
